.SS "int p4est_quadrant_in_range (const \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP * fd, const \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP * ld, const \fBp4est_quadrant_t\fP * quadrant)"

.PP
Report whether a quadrant fits into the limits of a quadrant range\&. The range's boundaries are determined by its first and last descendant\&. Such descendants are for example stored in each tree of a p4est_t\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIfd\fP First descendant quadrant of a range\&. Thus its level must be P4EST_QMAXLEVEL\&. Must be valid, its data is ignored\&. 
.br
\fIld\fP Last descendant quadrant of a range\&. Thus it must not be smaller than \fIfd\fP and its level must be P4EST_QMAXLEVEL\&. Must be valid, its data is ignored\&. 
.br
\fIquadrant\fP Quadrant checked to be fully inside the range\&. Must at least be extended, its data is ignored\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
True if and only if quadrant is contained in range\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBSee also\fP
.RS 4
\fBp4est_quadrant_is_extended\fP 
.RE
.PP

